              <p>{{ site.hours.display }} To schedule, call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> or book online at <a href="/contact#schedule">our scheduling page</a>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <h2 class="section-heading fade-up" style="margin-top:var(--space-2xl);">Cost, Insurance &amp; Scheduling</h2>

        <div class="faq-list" role="list">

          <div class="faq-item fade-up" role="listitem">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-9">
              How much do dental implants cost?
            </button>
            <div id="faq-9" class="faq-answer">
              <p>It depends on how many teeth are involved, whether you need bone grafting, and the type of final teeth you choose. We don't quote fees over the phone, because an accurate number requires a 3D scan and an exam. After your consultation and planning, you'll receive a written treatment plan with your full fee before anything is scheduled.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item fade-up" role="listitem">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-10">
              Do you take insurance?
            </button>
            <div id="faq-10" class="faq-answer">
              <p>We file claims with your dental insurance for you. We don't accept assignment of benefits, so payment is due at the time of service and your insurer reimburses you directly. Our team can help you understand what your plan is likely to cover before treatment.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item fade-up" role="listitem">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-11">
              I'm only in Florida part of the year. Can I still do treatment here?
            </button>
            <div id="faq-11" class="faq-answer">
              <p>Yes. Bring your arrival and departure dates to your consultation, and we'll plan surgery, healing, and your final teeth around your time in Florida.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item fade-up" role="listitem">
            <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-12">
              What is your cancellation policy?
            </button>
            <div id="faq-12" class="faq-answer">
              <p>We ask for at least 72 hours' notice to change an appointment with IV anesthesia, because an anesthesiologist is reserved for you. Late changes to those appointments carry a $1,000 fee. Missed or late-canceled regular appointments carry a $75 fee.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

